    //
    // We treat the computation as:
    //   - mean: column-wise reduction over samples
    //   - covariance: Gram matrix of the centered data:
    //         Cov = (1 / (N - 1)) * X_centered^T * X_centered
    //     with X_centered(s, f) = centered(f, s)
